  "description": "Only after Empress Lizzie died did Emperor Leon realize his foolishness and regretted it too late, but the time had already passed. \n\nWith Leon's wishes, the Witch of the Clock Tower turned back time to the day Leon first met Empress Lizzie, and all Leon had to do, after returning to the past, was to make Lizzie happy. \n\nBut the influence of turning back time was greater than he thought. Will Leon be able to make a happy ending with Lizzie this time?\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
